cookbook/references/kaggriculture-grammar-heads-sit-behind-isaiahs-actor-projection.md-26-- **Sampling.** Exact Gumbel-max throughout. `couple_market_kinds` implements the HIRE correction: the raw-HIRE prefix masks HIRE where capacity is exhausted, and the argmax is re-taken over the same perturbed scores. Densities use the final-HIRE prefix. STOP is the first final NONE, which keeps its slot-7 density; the sentinel has zero density.
